     <td style=\"width:400px;\">\n              \n      <img height=\"auto\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/oKvxmpgImkZb3TwM9ii4/media/667c7b5ab458d55a15346991.jpeg\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"400\">\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n          </tbody>\n\n        </table>\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n     \n    <div style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;border-width:0px;margin:0px auto 0px auto;border-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;max-width:600px;\">\n        \n        <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;width:100%;border-radius:0px;\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-top:10px;border-color:transparent;direction:ltr;font-size:0px;text-align:center;\">\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The One Due Diligence Mistake That Could Tank Your Business Acquisition</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Hi Sara,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Buying a business? You\u2019re probably knee-deep in financial statements, debt service coverage ratios, and making sure the numbers check out.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">But do you know what <em>most buyers</em> completely ignore?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The employee handbook.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Yes, that legally questionable 70-page document no one\u2014including the seller\u2014has ever actually read. And yet, <em>skipping it</em> nearly torpedoed a deal I worked on last week.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>The Landmine Hiding in Plain Sight</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A buyer was acquiring a small business\u2014just five employees, all women. Everyone was excited. I casually asked for the employment handbook, mostly as a formality.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">They sent it over <em>as a joke</em>, like, <em>\u201cSure, if you really want to waste your time.\u201d</em></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Well, guess what I found?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The seller had unknowingly adopted big-company policies (think FMLA, ADA) that didn\u2019t even apply to them.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Buried in the fine print? A 12-week paid maternity leave policy\u2014which the seller <em>had no idea existed</em>.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The five employees? <em>They definitely knew.</em></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Now the buyer had a tough choice:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">\u279d Match the policy and take a financial hit.</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">\u279d Cut it and risk losing the entire team post-close.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Oh, and they weren\u2019t allowed to talk to employees before closing\u2014so they had to make the call <em>blind</em>.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Why This Matters (Even in an Asset Purchase)</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><em>\"It\u2019s an asset purchase\u2014I\u2019m not taking on liabilities, so who cares?\"</em></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Because you\u2019re not just buying <em>assets</em>, you\u2019re buying <em>people</em>. Employees don\u2019t magically reset their expectations just because ownership changes hands.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you don\u2019t honor policies they were promised, they\u2019ll leave.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>What You Should Be Checking (That You\u2019re Probably Not)</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">\u279d The employee handbook (yes, really\u2014just skim it).<br> \u279d Hidden liabilities in PTO, benefits, or outdated workplace policies that could become <em>your</em> problem.<br> \u279d Anything that might make employees feel like they got a raw deal when you take over.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Most buyers only realize this <em>after</em> key employees start quitting\u2014or when they find themselves stuck with unexpected financial obligations.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Don\u2019t be that buyer.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you want to avoid post-close chaos,</span><span style=\"color: #3425db !important; font-size: 14px; color: #3425db !important\"> </span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/dbd1f5f8fa4?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: #3425db !important; font-size: 14px; color: #3425db !important\">check out our courses on Deal Academy </span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">for expert guidance on running a smooth diligence process.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">To deals that don\u2019t implode,<br>Sara Sharp<strong><br></strong>Partner, SK&amp;S Law Group<br>Business Consultant &amp; Founder of Deal Academy</span></p><p><strong><em>P.S. If you're looking to buy or sell an accounting firm, and want me to keep an eye out for you, </em></strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/6b126ee295a?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\"><strong><em>fill out this form here</em></strong></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\"><strong><em>.</em></strong></span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><p>For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/80087c1c6b3?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Dealmakers Youtube Channel </span></a>where you'll find Sara's <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/fcf029be882?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;v=csIoWCXhXsE&amp;t=15s\" title=\"Weekly Wine Down\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Weekly Wine Down,</span></a> where she talks about what she's seen in the industry this week and interviews with M&amp;A Experts and Dealmakers.</p><p>You can check out some recent Dealmakers podcast episodes by clicking the images below.</p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"full\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"min-width:100%;max-width:100%;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"\">\n              \n        <a href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/6407bb95612?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\" target=\"_blank\">\n          \n      <img height=\"auto\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/oKvxmpgImkZb3TwM9ii4/media/67efc03939379a1a08026c2f.jpeg\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;min-width:100%;width:100%;max-width:100%;font-siz